#: about/konq_aboutpage.cc:102
msgid ""
"With Konqueror you have your filesystem at your command, browsing local or "
"networked drives with equal ease. Thanks to the component technology used "
"throughout KDE 2, Konqueror is also a full featured, easy to use and "
"comfortable Web Browser, which you can use to explore the Internet."
msgstr "Avou Konqueror, vos v' rindoz maisse di vosse sistinme di fitchîs eyet vos betchtez åjheymint avå les plakes, k' ele seyexhe coinreces ou so ene rantoele.  Gråce al tecnolodjeye des 'components' eployeye tot costé dins KDE 2, vos poloz eto eployî Konqueror come betchteu po discovri tote li daegntoele: il a totes les usteyes ki vos sårîz sondjî po çoula, et il est mo åjhey a miner."

#: about/konq_aboutpage.cc:107
msgid ""
"Simply enter the Internet address (e.g. <A "
"HREF=\"http://www.kde.org\">http://www.kde.org</A>) of the web page you want "
"and press Enter, or choose one of the entries in your Bookmarks menu."
msgstr "Vos n' avoz k' a taper l' adresse daegntoele (metans: <A HREF=\"http://www.kde.org\">http://www.kde.org</A>) del waibe ki vos voloz vey et tchôkî so Intreye, ou bén tchwezi yene des intrêyes dins vosse dressîye Rimårkes."

#: about/konq_aboutpage.cc:110
msgid ""
"If you want to go back to the previous web page, press the button <IMG "
"WIDTH=16 HEIGHT=16 SRC=\"%1\"> &nbsp;(\"Back\") in the toolbar."
msgstr "Si vos voloz rivni en erî sol waibe di dvant, clitchî sol boton <IMG WIDTH=16 HEIGHT=16 SRC=\"%1\"> &nbsp;(\"Erî\") dins li båre ås usteyes."

#: about/konq_aboutpage.cc:113
msgid ""
"To go back to the home directory of your local filesystem press <IMG "
"WIDTH=16 HEIGHT=16 SRC=\"%1\"> &nbsp; (\"Home\"). "
msgstr "Po rivni a vosse ridant måjhon, dins vosse sistinme di fitchîs coinrece, tchôkîz so <IMG WIDTH=16 HEIGHT=16 SRC=\"%1\"> &nbsp; (\"Måjhon\"). "

#: about/konq_aboutpage.cc:115
msgid "For more detailed documentation on Konqueror click <A HREF=\"%1\">here</A>."
msgstr "Po-z e savu d' pus so Konqueror clitchîz  <A HREF=\"%1\">vaici</A>."

#: about/konq_aboutpage.cc:117
msgid ""
"<I>Tuning Tip:</I> If you want the Konqueror web browser to start faster, "
"you can turn off this information screen by clicking <A "
"HREF=\"%1\">here</A>. You can re-enable it by choosing the Help -> Konqueror "
"Introduction menu option, and then pressing Window -> Save View Profile "
"\"Web Browsing\"."
msgstr "<I>Bon a savu:</I> Si vos voloz ki li betchteu Konqueror s' enonde pus roed, vos lî poloz dîre di n' nén håyner cisse waitroûlêye d' informåcions tot clitchant <A HREF=\"%1\">vaici</A>.  Si vos candjîz d' idêye, alez dins Aidance -> Adrovaedje Konqueror; adon, clîtchîz so Purnea -> Schaper Profil di Vuwe \"Betchtaedje avå li Daegntoele\"."

#: about/konq_aboutpage.cc:145
msgid ""
"Konqueror is designed to embrace and support Internet standards. The aim is "
"to fully implement the officially sanctioned standards from organizations "
"such as the W3 and OASIS, while also adding extra support for other common "
"usability features that arise as de facto standards across the Internet. "
"Along with this support, for such functions as favicons, Internet Keywords, "
"and <A HREF=\"%1\">XBEL bookmarks</A>, Konqueror also implements:"
msgstr "Konqueror est bati po rprindre a s' conte eyet sopoirter les standårds del Daegntoele.  Li såme est di mete en oûve tos les standårds oficielmint aprovés pa des soces come li W3 eyet OASIS, sins rovyî li sopoirt d' ôtes cayets corants ki divnèt des standårds de facto sol Daegntoele.  Al copete di ci sopoirt la, po des foncsions come les favicons, les mots clés Internet eyet les <A HREF=\"%1\">rmårkes XBEL</A>, Konqueror met ossu en oûve:"

#: about/konq_aboutpage.cc:152
